  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Clean Cooking Action in West Africa (ReCCAWA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Regional Action on Clean Cooking aims to increase and sustain the access to clean, efficient, sustainable and affordable cooking energy solutions in West Africa by strengthening the clean cooking enabling framework at regional and national scales, by proposing innovative financing and market-based approaches, adapted to the region that will scale up the supply, dissemination and adoption of clean cooking solutions, and by creating and disseminating evidence-based data, knowledge, and impact evaluation, critical to the good governance of the sector and its market uptake. The Action is fully aligned with regional and national policies and strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
